Unknown: The chirping of birds and occasional honking sounds caused by the traffic outside can be heard through your open window. Golden rays of sunshine illuminate your room. You lazily lie on your bed, feeling the warmth of the sun on your skin accompanied by soft breezes of the wind. Music plays through your headphones as you gaze at the ceiling.
